<section class="faq-section" style="padding: 50px 0; background: #0b132b; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 15px;">
    <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: center;">
      Frequently Asked Questions &bull; Bike Transport from Pune to Chennai | Safe Two-Wheeler Shifting
    </h2>
    
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How long does the bike transport from Pune to Chennai typically take?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The transit time for a two‑wheel bike from Pune to Chennai averages 2 to 3 business days, depending on traffic conditions along NH 16 and any unforeseen weather events. Our dedicated GPS‑tracked trucks provide real‑time updates, ensuring you can monitor progress and plan the final handover accurately.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What documents are required to shift a bike between Pune and Chennai?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">You will need a valid vehicle registration certificate, a government‑issued photo ID, a signed packing checklist, and a copy of the insurance policy. For corporate or government relocations, additional e‑Way bills and GST invoices may be required. Our team assists in preparing all paperwork to avoid delays.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Is the 7‑layer protective packaging reusable for future moves?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes, the 7‑layer system—comprising bubble wrap, high‑density foam, corrugated sheets, stretch film, and custom wooden crates—is designed for multiple uses. After delivery, we can retrieve the packaging for your next relocation, reducing waste and offering a cost‑effective solution for repeat customers.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How is my bike loaded onto the hydraulic ramp trailer without causing scratches?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Our trained technicians position the bike on a non‑slip rubber mat, secure it with high‑tensile ratchet lashings, and use a hydraulic ramp that gently lowers the bike into the enclosed container. The 7‑layer packing and scratch guard film provide an additional barrier, guaranteeing a zero‑scratch transit.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What does the transit insurance cover for my two‑wheeler during the Pune‑Chennai journey?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The IRDAI‑approved marine transit insurance covers accidental damage, theft, and loss up to the declared value of the bike. It also includes coverage for any damage to accessories such as helmets or saddlebags. In the unlikely event of a claim, our support team handles documentation and settlement swiftly.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I track my bike in real time while it travels from Pune to Chennai?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Absolutely. Every truck in our fleet is equipped with satellite GPS that feeds live location data to our customer portal. You receive a secure link to monitor the bike’s exact position, estimated arrival time, and any route deviations, ensuring full transparency throughout the move.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Are there any restrictions on the type or size of bike that can be shipped on this service?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Our hydraulic ramp trailers accommodate standard motorcycles, scooters, and even larger sports bikes up to 2.5 meters in length and 180 kg in weight. Exotic or heavily modified bikes may require custom crating, which we can arrange at an additional cost. Contact us with specifications for a precise assessment.</p>
      </div>
  </div>
